{"1954210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speedboat League", "steam_appid": 1954210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedboat League</strong> is a fast, thrilling, and visually striking boat racing game, inspired by classic arcade hits like <i>Wave Race</i> and <i>Eliminator Boat Duel</i>, blended with the excitement of modern kart racers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race at top speed and blast your rivals away with powerful, weaponized speedboats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic weapon system: fire immediately or collect upgrades for even more powerful attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unlockables to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 stages, each with mirror variations — a total of 16 tracks to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes, including standard races, eliminator, and time trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local split-screen multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode for a deeper solo experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full boat customization — stand out from the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your speedboat season starts now — jump in and dominate the waves!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedboat League</strong> is a fast, thrilling, and visually striking boat racing game, inspired by classic arcade hits like <i>Wave Race</i> and <i>Eliminator Boat Duel</i>, blended with the excitement of modern kart racers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race at top speed and blast your rivals away with powerful, weaponized speedboats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</